Top-level ELIZA CLI.

``` use clap::Parser; use eliza::cli::{Cli, Commands};

let cli = Cli::parse_from(["eliza", "serve", "--port", "8787"]); assert!(matches!(cli.command, Commands::Serve(_))); ```

Usage: eliza <COMMAND>

Commands:
  serve  Run the local provider-compatible ELIZA HTTP server
  help   Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
